% Comparative constructions introduce a 'comp' relation (comp, comp_equal,
% comp_less, ...) whose label is shared with the gradable adjective and whose
% ARG1 is the adjective's eventuality.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Comparatives/):
%   h:comp[ARG1 e]
%   h:*_a*[ARG0 e]

pattern { C [pred=re"comp\(_.*\)?"]; C -[1=ARG1, post=EQ]-> A; A [pos="a"] }
